      "sector": "finance",
      "title": "End-to-End Digital Business Workflows: Transforming KYB-KYC-KYS via EU Business Wallet",
      "summary": "Use Case: This End-to-End Digital Business Workflow automates and secures high-assurance corporate onboarding across the entire business lifecycle, covering Know Your Business (KYB), Know Your Customer (KYC) for the financial sector, and Know Your Supplier (KYS) in a single, reusable process.\nProblem: Manual corporate verification is slow, costly, and high-friction. Gathering nested corporate data to comply with the new EU reegulation ( AMLR , GWG, Submission,etc),periodic review and preventing invoice fraud are critical pain points.\nValue: Dramatically reduces onboarding times, minimizes administrative overhead, and mitigates transaction risks. Credentials are issued once and seamlessly reused across the EU.\nOrganizations: Bundesanzeiger (Identity Issuer), Deutsche Bank (Account Issuer/Verifier), Bosch (Holder/KYS Verifier), SBB (Supplier Holder), and legal representatives (personal EUDI &amp; signers).\nWallets &amp; VCs: EU Business Wallets (Procivis/Spheerity) secure corporate credentials (EBWOID, EUCC, IBAN,etc ) using OpenID4VCI/VP and SD-JWT standards. This replaces paper checks with high-assurance, tamper-proof, decentralized identity verification that is fully eIDAS 2.0 compliant.",
      "organizationName": "Robert Bosch GmbH",
      "productionDeployment": "no",
