      "imageUrl": "https://fides.community/app/uploads/2026/08/GDC_End2End_Digital-Business-Workflows_1.0.png",
      "userJourney": "Phase 1: KYB - Foundation : Bosch Obtaining  EBWOID and EUCC from Bundesanzeiger\n1. Bosch Representativ presents personal attributes via EUDI Wallet to Bundesanzeiger (EBW Spherity).\n2.Bundesanzeiger verifies and check against official registry records and issues the EBWOID to  Bosch EBW (Procivis Desk)\n3.Bosch presents the EBWOID and issue EU Company Credential (EUCC) to Bosch EBW.\n\nPhase 2: KYC-Finance:  Onboarding Bosch at Deutsche Bank)\n3. KYC Process: Bosch presents its EBWOID and EUCC alongside multi-source attestations (Ownership, Control, UBO, CompanyInfo, ...) to Deutsche Bank (EBW Procivis).\n4. Deutsche Bank verify the presented proofs and additionally  verify the identity of calculated UBOs under EU AMLR rules (EUDI  Wallet)\n5. Contract signinng is trigger using a wallet-bound QES, and Deutsche Bank issues a verified IBAN Owner Attestation to Bosch EBW.\n\nPhase 3: KYS - Self Supplier onboarding of SBB at Bosch and start deliver\n6. SBB EBW runs Phases 1 and 2 to establish its verified identity.\n7. SBB EBW presents all required credentials to Bosch for instant, automated KYS onboarding.\n8. SBB EBW delivers ordered parts and issues an eInvoice directly to Bosch EBW.",
